{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;Reclaim the Souls, Protect the Dimensions!&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/a2ba3251c4c7537eb3cfeb9ffd5df211.avif?t=1774336581\" width=683 height=911 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong>  <br>Akane, Koro, and Shiro finally achieved peace after their deadly battle with Dark Ego in the first game. However, that peace did not last long.  <br>The demon <strong>Belial</strong>, revealing his hidden identity, devises a sinister plan called &quot;Species Unification&quot; and steals souls from countless dimensions, turning them into lifeless husks.  <br>In this adventure, a new companion joins the party: <strong>Lea</strong>, a mysterious onmyoji girl. The cat girls embark on a journey to reach the &quot;End of Dimensions&quot; where Belial awaits, in order to stop his evil plan.  <br>Throughout their journey across dimensions, can Akane and her friends reclaim the lost souls and restore balance to the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/e1644bcb35d2e4c2411784fd59305cad.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore world-famous landmarks corrupted by darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various backgrounds including the Eiffel Tower, downtown Tokyo, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and bosses appear in each dimension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/5297c422eb126ac3d29872eea7f01664.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/7df491a4990f75de57b52279389445e5.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/7df491a4990f75de57b52279389445e5.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Archmage Koro</strong>: Freeze enemies with ice magic and shatter them with her magic staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akane</strong>: A power-type warrior who crushes frozen enemies with devastating strikes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lea</strong>: An onmyoji who attacks with a giant brush and deals additional damage with splattered paint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique combat styles and magic skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/9b3ef422f4fa444c029f50f436a237c0.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> - When Magic Staffs Become Blunt Weapons!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique concept of physically beating enemies with magic staffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect harmony of intense melee combos and spectacular magic effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry System</strong>: Deflect enemy attacks with perfect timing and stun them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aerial Combos</strong>: Launch enemies into the air for continuous strikes! Each hit produces a &quot;Ding!&quot; and drops a coin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive coin acquisition system just like Mario's coin blocks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/663ced08022ae8c49654d9e1ca16760c.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/361801c76af071c54d3a14c62d717590.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/361801c76af071c54d3a14c62d717590.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Combat: Classic beat 'em up style with satisfying impact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Battles: Tense soul-like elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique bosses including the Dark Knight of a French castle and the Corrupted Druid of downtown Tokyo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic boss battles through the Parry-Stun-Combo cycle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/cab6d18ce07704e1d6fb54064381a278.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/e5825fddde5777f1da6fe4bb6817551a.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/e5825fddde5777f1da6fe4bb6817551a.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect dimensions together with a friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo plays utilizing character synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic cooperative combat where Koro freezes, Akane shatters, and Lea's paint deals additional damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/2be304d9a0f174919d19e220d927f776.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your characters with coins acquired from aerial combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new magic skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade various stats including attack power, parry timing, combo damage, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of growing stronger against increasingly powerful enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/7112e45caaab805eab0ef0af04736749.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/38bc74b0aa7678f57d71dc1b29e0ecbd.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/38bc74b0aa7678f57d71dc1b29e0ecbd.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/38bc74b0aa7678f57d71dc1b29e0ecbd.mp4?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced graphics and impact feedback compared to the predecessor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular magic effects and satisfying attack animations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f3152f7f1030f177e8e3a34cdb3bdd48.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Campaign</strong>: A journey across dimensions to stop Belial's plan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong>: 2-player cooperative play with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush</strong>: Consecutive boss battle challenge mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong>: Step-by-step learning of parry and combo systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand adventure of the cat girls' friendship, survival, and protecting the world begins now.  <br><strong>Join the journey to protect the dimensions!</strong>  <br>It's time to reclaim souls, revive lost vitality, and face the true end of the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=774 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.mp4?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3756910?t=1774336581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/d3804c086928af766dadeed2956f44c757969f04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774336581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/02ad37a86183d55887e405445f9b8dc542c8b195/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774336581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/02ad37a86183d55887e405445f9b8dc542c8b195/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774336581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Please follow our official account</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/030e1b00fc994a49d0126ffc95f730bd.webp?t=1774336581\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta