 through the Parry-Stun-Combo cycle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/cab6d18ce07704e1d6fb54064381a278.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/e5825fddde5777f1da6fe4bb6817551a.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/e5825fddde5777f1da6fe4bb6817551a.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect dimensions together with a friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo plays utilizing character synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic cooperative combat where Koro freezes, Akane shatters, and Lea's paint deals additional damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/2be304d9a0f174919d19e220d927f776.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your characters with coins acquired from aerial combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new magic skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade various stats including attack power, parry timing, combo damage, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the joy of growing stronger against increasingly powerful enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/7112e45caaab805eab0ef0af04736749.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/38bc74b0aa7678f57d71dc1b29e0ecbd.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/38bc74b0aa7678f57d71dc1b29e0ecbd.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/38bc74b0aa7678f57d71dc1b29e0ecbd.mp4?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced graphics and impact feedback compared to the predecessor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular magic effects and satisfying attack animations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/f3152f7f1030f177e8e3a34cdb3bdd48.avif?t=1774336581\" width=876 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Campaign</strong>: A journey across dimensions to stop Belial's plan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode</strong>: 2-player cooperative play with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Rush</strong>: Consecutive boss battle challenge mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong>: Step-by-step learning of parry and combo systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand adventure of the cat girls' friendship, survival, and protecting the world begins now.  <br><strong>Join the journey to protect the dimensions!</strong>  <br>It's time to reclaim souls, revive lost vitality, and face the true end of the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.poster.avif?t=1774336581\" width=774 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.webm?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/extras/d8798ca25e185e99e9f95f626c5f9675.mp4?t=1774336581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Minimum Studio Corp."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756910/5139ad58d5f6fd49000011c98e63c42cd7298b82/header.jpg?t=1774336581","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3756910/825182139/d63ffce0971617f759ce8236070bf20818925062/1768530935/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768531937","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3756910/82